---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Cleaning Services in the GTA | Neat Squad"
description: "Explore Neat Squad's full range of cleaning services across the Greater Toronto Area: house, office, driveway, deep cleaning, and carpet & upholstery cleaning."
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    {% set crumbs = [{label: "Services"}] %}
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <h1>Cleaning services for every space</h1>
    <p class="lede">House, office, exterior, and specialty cleaning — all backed by the same detail-driven checklist, across the entire GTA.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for s in services %}
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">{{ icon(s.icon) }}</div>
        <h3><a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ s.heroSubheadline }}</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    {% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
